# Copy to .dev.vars for local testing. .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit real keys.
# In production these live in Cloudflare > Pages > Settings > Environment variables.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY is the only one you need. annabelart.online is verified in
# Resend, so the code already sends from hello@annabelart.online and delivers to
# hello@annabelart.online, which Cloudflare Email Routing forwards to Annabel.
#
# Leave the two below commented out. They only exist to override those defaults,
# and if you set INQUIRY_TO here or in Cloudflare it wins over the Email Routing
# rule — so to change who receives inquiries, change the rule in Cloudflare
# instead. The defaults live in functions/_inquiry.ts.

RESEND_API_KEY=
# INQUIRY_FROM="Annabel Art <hello@annabelart.online>"  # only to send from elsewhere
# INQUIRY_TO="someone@example.com"                      # only to reroute inquiries
